@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam linetype ortho

title Control Loop Block Diagram

rectangle "Reference Input\nr(t)" as Ref
rectangle "Neural Controller" as NC
rectangle "Control Element" as Act
rectangle "Plant (PTn System)" as Plant
rectangle "Sensor / Measurement" as Sensor
rectangle "Summation\n(e = r - y)" as Sum

Ref --> Sum : r(t)
Sensor --> Sum : y(t)
Sum --> NC : e(t)
NC --> Act : u(t)
Act --> Plant : u(t)
Plant --> Sensor : y(t)

note right of NC
  - MLP / Jordan network
  - Online weight update
  - Adaptive Learning rate η
end note

note right of Plant
  - PTn dynamics
  - Saturation point pre-set
end note

@enduml